/*
    This is the grammar file used for producing railroad (rr) diagrams for the
    JDBC Connection URL

    NOTE:
      This file is processed to produce a series of *.png files, one for each rule.
      If you change the name of a rule then the output filename will also change,
      and this needs to be updated in the Command Reference section where it
      references this static image filename.

    This file was originally converted on from ANTLR format to EBNF on
    Mon Jan 30, 2023, 11:43 (UTC+11) by antlr_4-to-w3c v0.62 which is
    Copyright (c) 2011-2022 by Gunther Rademacher <grd@gmx.net>

    Converted by the utility at: https://bottlecaps.de/convert/
*/

connectionURL ::= 'jdbc:se:'
                  (
                    hostAndPort
//                    defaultLocation?
                    properties?
                  )?

hostAndPort   ::= '//' host (':' port)? ( ',' host (':' port)? )*
host          ::= hostName | hostIPv4Address | '[' hostIPv6Address ']'
//defaultLocation ::= '/' catalogName ( '/' schemaName )?
properties    ::= '?' key '=' value ('&' key '=' value)*